---
// Pricing & Investment Component
---
<section id="pricing" class="py-28 border-t border-slate-900 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-400 mb-3">Transparent Investment</h2>
        <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Predictable pricing tailored to enterprise scale.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Tier 1: Sprint / Audit -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Audit & Strategy Sprint</div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 font-mono">$3,500 <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-normal">/ project</span></div>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
                    Comprehensive technical architecture audit, brand positioning review, and actionable roadmap for existing digital products.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Full Code & Security Audit</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Brand & UI/UX Evaluation</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Scalability Roadmap Document</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="#contact" class="w-full py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-white font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors text-center text-sm">
                Inquire for Sprint
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2: Full-Service Project (Featured) -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border-2 border-emerald-500/50 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-xl shadow-emerald-950/30">
            <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                Most Popular
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 mb-2">Full-Service Build</div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 font-mono">$12,000+ <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-normal">/ engagement</span></div>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
                    End-to-end design, full-stack engineering, cloud infrastructure setup, and launch support for new platforms or complete re-launches.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Custom Brand Identity & UI/UX</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Full-Stack Web App Development</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Cloud Architecture & CI/CD</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> 30-Day Post-Launch Support</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="#contact" class="w-full py-3 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-emerald-500 transition-colors text-center text-sm shadow-sm">
                Initiate Project Scoping
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3: Enterprise Retainer -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-2">Enterprise Retainer</div>
                <div class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 font-mono">$6,500 <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-normal">/ month</span></div>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
                    Dedicated engineering, continuous cloud optimization, growth marketing, and priority architecture advisory on a recurring monthly basis.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Dedicated Technical Team</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> 24/7 Uptime & Security Monitoring</li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">&#10003;</span> Growth & Conversion Optimization</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="#contact" class="w-full py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-white font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors text-center text-sm">
                Secure Retainer
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>